        <definition>bool _rbusSetHandlerOptions::commit</definition>
        <argsstring></argsstring>
        <name>commit</name>
        <qualifiedname>_rbusSetHandlerOptions::commit</qualifiedname>
        <briefdescription>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Commit flag indicating which set operation is the last set operation in a particular session. Set to true to for the final set of a session. Set to false to for all other sets of a session, which indicates that the set operation should be remembered until the final set occurs. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
